{{> studentTop}}
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE WHAT COMES NEXT</p><h1>Find My Career</h1><p class="muted">Match your assessed BSTM knowledge to possible career directions.</p></div></div>
<div class="notice info">These are exploratory learning recommendations using transparent starter rules. They are not job offers or employment probabilities. Unlocked and ongoing courses are not counted as earned knowledge. Faculty should validate pathway requirements.</div>
<details class="card space-top"><summary>How these recommendations are matched · {{evidenceDate}}</summary><p class="small muted">The system uses predefined BSTM competency-to-career rules and your latest completed course attempt per course. Knowledge-only where no completed practical evidence exists; otherwise 70% knowledge + 30% faculty rubric evidence. Ongoing courses are shown as learning suggestions, not earned knowledge. These are career recommendations, not verified job vacancies or employment probabilities.</p>{{#each evidenceSources}}<p class="small">{{title}} · v{{version}} · {{date}} · final assessment {{score}}%</p>{{else}}<p class="small">No completed courses yet. {{#if hasBaseline}}Your latest knowledge diagnostic is used.{{else}}Take the knowledge diagnostic to establish initial evidence.{{/if}}</p>{{/each}}<a class="small text-link" href="/student/assessment">{{#if hasBaseline}}Update knowledge diagnostic →{{else}}Take knowledge diagnostic →{{/if}}</a></details><div class="grid cols-2 space-top">{{#each tracks}}<article class="card"><div class="row wrap"><span class="chip">{{label}}</span>{{#if preferred}}<span class="chip rose">Related to your interest</span>{{/if}}</div><h2 class="space-top">{{title}}</h2><p class="small muted">{{explanation}}</p><h3>Supporting knowledge areas</h3><ul class="list-clean small">{{#each strengths}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{else}}<li class="muted">Not enough supporting evidence yet.</li>{{/each}}</ul><h3 class="space-top">Areas to develop or assess</h3><ul class="list-clean small">{{#each gaps}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{else}}<li>Seek practical application and faculty feedback.</li>{{/each}}</ul><p class="small space-top"><strong>Additional qualifications to verify:</strong> {{#if qualifications}}{{qualifications}}{{else}}Confirm training and employer-specific requirements with faculty.{{/if}}</p><h3 class="space-top">Connected courses</h3><ul class="list-clean small">{{#each relatedCourses}}<li><a class="text-link" href="/student/courses/{{id}}">{{title}}</a> <span class="chip gray">{{learningStatus}}</span></li>{{else}}<li class="muted">No published courses are currently linked to these competency areas.</li>{{/each}}</ul><p class="small muted space-top">Verify role-specific qualifications and employer requirements separately.</p></article>{{/each}}</div>
<section class="card space-top"><div class="row wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">AI-ASSISTED CAREER MATCH</p><h2>Explain my career matches</h2></div><span class="chip gray">{{#if aiReady}}AI available{{else}}Configuration needed{{/if}}</span></div><p class="small muted">Predefined rules rank BSTM career recommendations. Gemini explains those matches and suggests learning next steps; it does not change your grades or claim available job openings.</p>{{#if aiReady}}<form action="/student/careers/generate" method="post" data-ai-form><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{csrf}}"><label class="answer"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required><span>I agree to send my competency scores and pathway labels to Gemini. My name, email, Student ID and profile text are excluded.</span></label><button class="button space-top">Find My Career Matches →</button><div class="career-search" data-ai-loading hidden aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true"><div class="career-map" aria-hidden="true"><span class="map-castle">🏰</span><span class="map-path"></span><span class="map-search">🧭</span><span class="map-spark">✨</span></div><strong data-ai-status>Mapping your BSTM strengths…</strong><p class="small muted">Checking your completed courses against career pathways.</p></div></form>{{else}}<p class="small muted">The system owner must configure GEMINI_API_KEY and GEMINI_MODEL to enable live AI explanations. Your rule-based career matches remain available.</p>{{/if}}{{#if ai}}<div class="divider"></div><span class="chip">AI career guidance · {{ai.generatedAt}}</span><p class="space-top">{{ai.summary}}</p><ul class="list-clean">{{#each ai.nextSteps}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul><p class="small muted">AI can make mistakes. Confirm advice with your faculty adviser.</p>{{/if}}</section>
<div class="section-heading"><h2>Courses for your next steps</h2><a href="/student/courses">View all →</a></div><div class="grid cols-3">{{#each recommendations}}<article class="card"><span class="chip">{{domain}}</span><h3 class="space-top">{{title}}</h3>{{#if locked}}<span class="chip">Complete prerequisites first</span>{{else}}<span class="chip">Available next step</span>{{/if}}<p class="small muted">{{description}}</p><a class="button secondary" href="/student/courses/{{id}}">Explore course →</a></article>{{else}}<div class="card"><p class="muted">Explore the catalog to reinforce your knowledge and ask faculty about practical learning opportunities.</p></div>{{/each}}</div>
{{> studentBottom}}
